eady?"]},{"at":[13,7],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_SchoolKidM","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SCHOOL_KID_M","source_id":3,"local_id":3,"source_local":"","facing":"right","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Battling with POKéMON is fun, I'll grant you that.\nBut one mustn't forget our love for the fine arts."]},{"at":[13,10],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_Artist1","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_ARTIST","source_id":4,"local_id":4,"source_local":"","facing":"right","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_LEFT_AND_RIGHT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["This ART MUSEUM… Well, you could see many fantastic paintings.\nAnd the CURATOR is a wonderful person.\nAmong artists like myself, this MUSEUM is an inspiration."]},{"at":[2,8],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_NinjaBoy","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_NINJA_BOY","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["This lady is pretty! She's like Mommy!"]},{"at":[3,8],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_Woman1","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_4","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["This POKéMON is adorable! Just like our little boy!"]},{"at":[11,3],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_Woman2","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_LILYCOVE_MUSEUM_PATRON_1","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_2","source_id":7,"local_id":7,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":true,"name":"居民","lines":["I'd heard that this ART MUSEUM got in some new paintings.\nSo, naturally I hurried over.\nAre the new paintings up on the second floor?"]},{"at":[19,3],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_Artist2","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_LILYCOVE_MUSEUM_PATRON_4","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_ARTIST","source_id":8,"local_id":8,"source_local":"LOCALID_MUSEUM_1F_ARTIST_2","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":true,"name":"居民","lines":["I aim to see many great paintings here and learn from them.\nI have this dream of one day having my artwork exhibited here."]},{"at":[2,2],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_FatMan","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_LILYCOVE_MUSEUM_TOURISTS","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_FAT_MAN","source_id":9,"local_id":9,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":true,"name":"居民","lines":["The ART MUSEUM has become a favorite tourist destination.\nIt's great for LILYCOVE… No, great for the HOENN region!\nThis is what I've heard--a lone TRAINER procured all the paintings upstairs."]},{"at":[6,2],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_PsychicM","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_LILYCOVE_MUSEUM_PATRON_3","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_PSYCHIC_M","source_id":10,"local_id":10,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":true,"name":"居民","lines":["Lately, the CURATOR has been unusually cheerful.\nI bet something good happened for him. Definitely."]}],"objects":[{"at":[1,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_FantasyPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's an odd landscape with bizarre and fantastic scenery."},{"at":[2,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_FantasyPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's an odd landscape with bizarre and fantastic scenery."},{"at":[5,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_BerryPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a delicious-looking painting of BERRIES.\nThis painting could make you hungry!"},{"at":[6,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_BerryPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a delicious-looking painting of BERRIES.\nThis painting could make you hungry!"},{"at":[9,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_OldPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a very old painting. The paint is peeling here and there."},{"at":[3,6],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_WomanPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a painting of a beautiful, smiling woman with a POKéMON on her lap."},{"at":[2,6],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_WomanPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a painting of a beautiful, smiling woman with a POKéMON on her lap."},{"at":[15,12],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_EventScript_BirdSculpture","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a replica of a famous sculpture.\nIt depicts an ancient BIRD POKéMON."},{"at":[11,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_OldPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a very old painting. The paint is peeling here and there."},{"at":[6,6],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_GrassPokemonPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a painting of GRASS POKéMON swaying in a breeze.\nThey appear to be enjoying the wind's gentle caress."},{"at":[17,9],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_StoneTablet","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a huge stone tablet inscribed with POKéMON and dense text in the small characters of an ancient, unreadable language."},{"at":[19,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_LegendaryPokemonPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a painting of a legendary POKéMON from long ago.\nThe artist painted this from imagination."},{"at":[20,1],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_LegendaryPokemonPainting","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a painting of a legendary POKéMON from long ago.\nThe artist painted this from imagination."},{"at":[18,9],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_StoneTablet","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a huge stone tablet inscribed with POKéMON and dense text in the small characters of an ancient, unreadable language."},{"at":[18,11],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_PokeBallSculpture","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a big POKé BALL carved from a black stone.\nIt was apparently used in festivals in the olden days."},{"at":[16,9],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_1F_EventScript_StoneTablet","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":"It's a huge stone tablet inscribed with POKéMON and dense text in the small characters of an ancient, unreadable language."}],"warps":[{"at":[9,13],"trigger":"down","to":{"region":"hoenn","map":"hoenn_lilycove","at":[11,5],"hoenn_native":true},"source_warp":0},{"at":[10,13],"trigger":"down","to":{"region":"hoenn","map":"hoenn_lilycove","at":[12,5],"hoenn_native":true},"source_warp":1},{"at":[16,1],"trigger":"step","to":{"region":"hoenn","map":"em_lilycove_city_lilycove_museum_2f","at":[13,1],"hoenn_native":true},"source_warp":2}],"coord_events":[],"allow_running":false,"allow_cycling":false}
